<title>USA: Stop &amp; Shop CFO Mcglinchey to retire Mar 21.</title>
<headline>Stop &amp; Shop CFO Mcglinchey to retire Mar 21.</headline>
<dateline>QUINCY, Mass. 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Stop &amp; Shop Cos Inc Wednesday announced the retirement of Joseph McGlinchey, senior vice president and chief financial officer, effective March 21, 1997.</p>
<p>Stop &amp; Shop said Brian Hotarek will succeed McGlinchey as chief financial officer upon his retirement.</p>
